---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Our Services — Dirt Girls Gardening"
  description="Garden maintenance services on the Mornington Peninsula including weeding, pruning, planting, mulching, garden cleanups and seasonal care."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Our Garden Services</h1>
      <p>We provide a complete range of garden maintenance services across the Mornington Peninsula. Every garden is different, and we tailor our service to suit yours.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-alt">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Garden Maintenance</h3>
          <p>Regular scheduled visits to keep your garden looking its best. We'll weed, prune, tidy, and ensure everything stays healthy and beautiful throughout the year.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Weeding</h3>
          <p>Thorough weeding of garden beds, paths, and borders. We get to the roots so they don't come back in a hurry.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Pruning</h3>
          <p>Expert pruning for roses, shrubs, fruit trees, and ornamentals. Proper pruning at the right time of year makes all the difference.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Planting &amp; Garden Design</h3>
          <p>New plantings to fill gaps, refresh tired beds, or create something entirely new. We choose plants that thrive in Peninsula conditions.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Mulching</h3>
          <p>Quality mulch applied to the right depth to retain moisture, suppress weeds, and feed the soil. Essential for Peninsula gardens.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Garden Cleanups &amp; Makeovers</h3>
          <p>Whether it's a one-off tidy or a complete garden transformation, we'll get in there and get it done. No job is too overgrown.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Seasonal Care</h3>
          <p>Different seasons need different attention. From winter pruning to summer watering advice, we keep your garden on track all year.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="note">
        <p><strong>We specialise in garden care, not lawn mowing or large-scale hedging.</strong> For the best results, we focus on what we love.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-alt">
    <div class="container service-area">
      <h2>Service Area</h2>
      <p>We service the Mornington Peninsula including Mornington, Mount Martha, Frankston, Somerville, Hastings, Rosebud, Rye, Sorrento, Portsea, Dromana, Safety Beach, and surrounding areas.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="text-align: center;">
      <h2>Ready to get started?</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 auto var(--space-md);">Call Julie on <a href="tel:0412222251">0412 222 251</a> or get a free quote.</p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Free Quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
